{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Prima Materia XXV",
    "steam_appid": 3714460,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714460/extras/cf856c45f8ced0826c07546c7511234f.avif?t=1750021939\" width=590 height=253 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A local multiplayer brawler from the streets of Prague</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prima Materia</strong> is an experimental 3D fighting game created as part of the <strong>Fashion Week 2025 Tobias Equipment</strong> showcase. A stylistically uncompromising brawler with a unique aesthetic \u2014 reminiscent of classic fighters like <i>Mortal Kombat</i>, but reimagined through the lens of fashion and alchemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features characters based on real icons of the Czech rap and fashion scenes, captured through 3D scanning and transformed into avatars of chaos within a dark fantasy version of Prague.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fighter is a vessel of destruction \u2014 and a victim of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714460/extras/1781b292bdae0c72d0cac39c5b1a4a3b.webp?t=1750021939\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 <strong>LEGENDARY LORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to legend, a secret group of alchemists once operated beneath the cobbled streets of Prague. They uncovered the mystery of <i>Prima Materia</i> \u2014 the primal chaotic substance from which all matter is born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realizing its immense power, the alchemists split the substance into several relics, each containing a fragment of chaos. These relics held transformative powers \u2014 from reshaping bodies to defying death \u2014 and ultimately ignited a war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the streets of Prague have become blood-soaked arenas, where the fight for power, identity, and survival continues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714460/extras/1781b292bdae0c72d0cac39c5b1a4a3b.webp?t=1750021939\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 <strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Local multiplayer for 2 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Fast and brutal combat in the spirit of classic fighters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Real-time 3D scans of real-life personalities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Stylized environments inspired by gothic Prague</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos is the cause\u2026 and the consequence.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the arena. And restore the order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714460/extras/14711830de5e74baece7ef603091d4e9.avif?t=1750021939\" data-has-big width=800 height=188 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714460/extras/cf856c45f8ced0826c07546c7511234f.avif?t=1750021939\" width=590 height=253 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A local multiplayer brawler from the streets of Prague</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prima Materia</strong> is an experimental 3D fighting game created as part of the <strong>Fashion Week 2025 Tobias Equipment</strong> showcase. A stylistically uncompromising brawler with a unique aesthetic \u2014 reminiscent of classic fighters like <i>Mortal Kombat</i>, but reimagined through the lens of fashion and alchemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features characters based on real icons of the Czech rap and fashion scenes, captured through 3D scanning and transformed into avatars of chaos within a dark fantasy version of Prague.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fighter is a vessel of destruction \u2014 and a victim of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714460/extras/1781b292bdae0c72d0cac39c5b1a4a3b.webp?t=1750021939\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 <strong>LEGENDARY LORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to legend, a secret group of alchemists once operated beneath the cobbled streets of Prague. They uncovered the mystery of <i>Prima Materia</i> \u2014 the primal chaotic substance from which all matter is born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realizing its immense power, the alchemists split the substance into several relics, each containing a fragment of chaos. These relics held transformative powers \u2014 from reshaping bodies to defying death \u2014 and ultimately ignited a war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the streets of Prague have become blood-soaked arenas, where the fight for power, identity, and survival continues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714460/extras/1781b292bdae0c72d0cac39c5b1a4a3b.webp?t=1750021939\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 <strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Local multiplayer for 2 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Fast and brutal combat in the spirit of classic fighters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Real-time 3D scans of real-life personalities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Stylized environments inspired by gothic Prague</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos is the cause\u2026 and the consequence.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the arena. And restore the order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714460/extras/14711830de5e74baece7ef603091d4e9.avif?t=1750021939\" data-has-big width=800 height=188 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Stylizovan\u00e1 lok\u00e1ln\u00ed ml\u00e1ti\u010dka z temn\u00e9 fantasy Prahy. Prima Materia propojuje surov\u00e9 souboje s alchymi\u00ed, chaosem a m\u00f3dou. Zahraj si za 3D nasn\u00edman\u00e9 ikony \u010desk\u00e9 rapov\u00e9 a fashion sc\u00e9ny.",
